[redis] redis no value
  error: |A new row needs a value.|

[redis] redis null value
  error: |value cannot be NULL: Redis has no NULL to store.|

[redis] redis typed
  error: |A new row is a string key: leave its type empty.|

[redis] redis ttl zero
  error: |0 is not a TTL: it is a number of seconds above zero, and zero or less would delete the key.|

[redis] redis other table
  error: |other is not a grid DBDelve writes to.|

[redis] redis list index
  error: |A new item goes at the end of the list: leave its index empty.|

[redis] redis string family
  error: |A string holds one value: edit it rather than adding a row.|

[redis] redis zset no score
  error: |A new row needs a score.|

[redis] redis two words
  error: |two words does not name one key.|
